# ✦ Travora — Environment Variables

# Groq API Key (Primary — Recommended for Waylo Chat and Itinerary Planner)
# Get your free key at: https://console.groq.com
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# Google Gemini API Key (Secondary Fallback — Optional)
# Only required if you do not have a Groq key.
# Get your free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Note on other APIs: 
# Open-Meteo (Weather) and OpenStreetMap Nominatim (Geocoding) 
# do NOT require API keys. The app will work out of the box!
